#: ../../source/p-event_readme.md:153 ../../source/p-event_readme.md:210
msgid ""
"This method has the same arguments and options as `pEvent()` with the "
"addition of the following options:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/p-event_readme.md:159
msgid "count"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/p-event_readme.md:161
msgid "*Required*<br> Type: `number`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/p-event_readme.md:164
msgid ""
"The number of times the event needs to be emitted before the promise "
"resolves."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/p-event_readme.md:166
msgid "resolveImmediately"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/p-event_readme.md:171
msgid ""
"Whether to resolve the promise immediately. Emitting one of the "
"`rejectionEvents` won't throw an error."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/p-event_readme.md:173
msgid "**Note**: The returned array will be mutated when an event is emitted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/p-event_readme.md:205
msgid "pEvent.iterator(emitter, event, [options])"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/p-event_readme.md:206
msgid "pEvent.iterator(emitter, event, filter)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/p-event_readme.md:208
msgid ""
"Returns an [async iterator](http://2ality.com/2016/10/asynchronous-"
"iteration.html) that lets you asynchronously iterate over events of "
"`event` emitted from `emitter`. The iterator ends when `emitter` emits an"
" event matching any of the events defined in `resolutionEvents`, or "
"rejects if `emitter` emits any of the events defined in the "
"`rejectionEvents` option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/p-event_readme.md:216
msgid "limit"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/p-event_readme.md:218
msgid "Type: `number` *(non-negative integer)*<br> Default: `Infinity`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/p-event_readme.md:221
msgid ""
"Maximum number of events for the iterator before it ends. When the limit "
"is reached, the iterator will be marked as `done`. This option is useful "
"to paginate events, for example, fetching 10 events per page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/p-event_readme.md:223
msgid "resolutionEvents"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/p-event_readme.md:225
msgid "Type: `string[]`<br> Default: `[]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/p-event_readme.md:228
msgid "Events that will end the iterator."
msgstr ""

