msgid "Tip"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/p-event_readme.md:279
msgid "Dealing with calls that resolve with an error code"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/p-event_readme.md:281
msgid ""
"Some functions might use a single event for success and for certain "
"errors. Promises make it easy to have combined error handler for both "
"error events and successes containing values which represent errors."
msgstr ""

